{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Dresden, September 7\n\nDear Marie,\n\nI have arrived safely. The way went via Herzberg, where, as chance would have it, the niece of a country parson accompanied us as far as here. A pleasant, harmless little folk, who apparently endure the heat better than we do.\n\nIn Dresden I already found Privy Councillor Schulze at the inn. He actually wanted to go on, but I persuaded him to stay another day. We sat with Böttiger this morning and then visited the Picture Gallery. It was a pleasant repetition of the antiquities that we have often viewed, but art loses nothing of its value through repetition.\n\nThe evening is quiet. I am writing this only to reassure you.\n\nYour\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221195,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":162,"prompt_tokens":254,"total_tokens":416,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-gSUBbSORtPhp1z4Seimljq3yj3sGniVT","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":254,"prompt_ms":502.386,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.9778976377952757,"prompt_per_second":505.5873372267539,"predicted_n":162,"predicted_ms":3842.936,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.869167701863354,"predicted_per_second":41.89505107553183}}